(NULL, 'mc', 'What is the name of the genetic molecule that carries instructions for building and running living organisms?', 'fun_facts', '11_12', 'hard', true, '[{"label":"RNA","isCorrect":false},{"label":"ATP","isCorrect":false},{"label":"DNA","isCorrect":true},{"label":"mRNA","isCorrect":false}]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'DNA (deoxyribonucleic acid) is the molecule that contains the genetic instructions for the development, function, and reproduction of all living organisms.'),
(NULL, 'mc', 'Approximately how old is planet Earth?', 'fun_facts', '11_12', 'hard', true, '[{"label":"1 billion years","isCorrect":false},{"label":"2.5 billion years","isCorrect":false},{"label":"4.5 billion years","isCorrect":true},{"label":"10 billion years","isCorrect":false}]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'Earth is approximately 4.5 billion years old, formed from a cloud of gas and dust around our young Sun.'),
(NULL, 'mc', 'What is the term for an animal that eats both plants and other animals?', 'fun_facts', '11_12', 'hard', true, '[{"label":"Carnivore","isCorrect":false},{"label":"Herbivore","isCorrect":false},{"label":"Omnivore","isCorrect":true},{"label":"Detritivore","isCorrect":false}]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'An omnivore eats both plant and animal matter. Humans are omnivores, as are bears, pigs, and many other animals.');
